  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transport Police Taskforce - transport police taskforc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">transport polisteam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">The National Accord on Reconciliation act 2008 agreed on a number of institutional reforms to take place. One of them is reform of the police and the establishment of a National Task Force on Kenya Police Reforms to define the reforms. The task force has requested a study visit to Sweden to specifically look at oversight institutions, policing policy, community policing,</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">relationship within the criminal justice system, decentralisation and police accountability. The study visit will take place between 15-22 August 2009.</narrative>
  </description>
